                                                "sense_id": "e4fad6c4-09d8-340c-9d6f-f85516117da6",
                                                "text": "True Wit has ſeen its best days long ago, / It ne're look'd up, ſince we were dipt in Show: / When Senſe in Dogrel Rimes and Clouds was loſt, / And Dulneſs flouriſh'd at the Actors coſt."
